msgid "I welcome your request for peace between our civilizations, %(_player_)s. I will accept."
msgstr "Ik verwelkom uw verzoek voor vrede tussen onze volkeren, %(_player_)s. Ik accepteer."

msgid "I will accept your offer to become allies, %(_player_)s. We will both benefit from this partnership."
msgstr "Ik accepteer je aanbod voor bondgenootschap, %(_player_)s. Beiden zullen we profiteren van onze samenwerking."

msgid "I will ally with you, %(_player_)s, but only if you send me a tribute of %(_amount_)s %(_resource_)s."
